    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Combat Expertise.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using the Combat Expertise feat, you do not suffer Combat Expertise’s penalty on melee attack rolls on the first attack you make each turn. You still suffer the penalty on any additional attacks, including attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
